404 0 obj
<</Title(You are looking to create AT LEAST 3 birth plans. Think about what changes could happen. Eg. Home birth to hospital, spontaneous to induction etc. You would then create birth plans for each scenario with plan A being your ideal birth and plan C being a caesarean birth. Someone planning a Labour ward birth may do a plan A for that ideal birth they are working towards, a plan B for if they decide to have an induction or any augmentation \(waters being broken, the drip etc.\) and then a final plan C for caesarean. If plan A was a home birth or birth centre birth then there may be a plan B x2 for a change of birth place too!)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 379 0 R/Next 422 0 R>>
